expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Run one of the repository's hooks

Usage: specforge git hook [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run   Run the repository's hook as git would, its output on stderr; a hook that fails exits 1
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --in <DIR>
          Run as if typed in this directory, as `git -C` runs: its project, the repository it is in, and every typed path read from it

  -h, --help
          Print help
